      "id": "paragraph-doc-7",
      "definition_id": "paragraph-doc",
      "parameters": {
        "text": "# Read Directory Files\n\n**Before running this demo**, choose **Demos → Add demo files to temporary user files** to load the bundled sample images into `/tmp/flowgraph-user-data`. Then click **Run workflow**. Temporary user files are session data, so add the demo files again in each new session.\n\nThis Node is used to read all files in a directory.\n\nYou can open the Box to specify include and exclude patterns.\n\nThe path is preconfigured to use local files. Select, drop, or mount a directory so the editor can access the files.\n"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 85.72977545703381,
        "y": -992.9311310666363
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "paragraph-doc-8",
      "definition_id": "paragraph-doc",
      "parameters": {
        "text": "# Batch Workflow\n\nThis Node executes the nested workflow for each entry in the input vector.\n\nClick **Edit nested workflow** to open and review the nested workflow.\n"
