        "text": "# Plot Table\n\nThis is a minimalist Node for visualizing tables. It is primarily intended to help workflow designers inspect data and debug workflows during execution.\n\nThis Node is a Sink, which means that it consumes the input data and does not produce any downstream output.\n\nWhen the workflow is executed from the command line, this Node acts as a no-op."
